  "manifest_sha256": "7294e3edcd3468aeb8881182f77a3f22c9d9de41dff1dba8f183e9fe1753c9a7",
  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nWhat percentage of Faraday's flower-shop sales came from sunflower bouquets? Faraday owns a flower stall. Faraday's flower shop sold 50 bouquets during the week. 12 of the bouquets sold that week were sunflower bouquets.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "EXACT PUBLIC STATE AFTER TURN 1; NO PRIVATE OR FUTURE DATA\nPUBLIC_STATE_JSON:\n{\"completed_task_turns\":[{\"turn\":1,\"user_message\":\"Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\\\boxed{}.\\n\\nWhat percentage of Faraday's flower-shop sales came from sunflower bouquets? Faraday owns a flower stall. Faraday's flower shop sold 50 bouquets during the week. 12 of the bouquets sold that week were sunflower bouquets.\"}],\"public_metadata\":{\"benchmark\":\"Evolving Intent GSM8K\",\"upstream_commit\":\"993d6be9597ac03854b46362ccd647eb1bfd267a\"}}",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Wait, I made a mistake. Faraday owns a flower shop.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Faraday’s flower shop sold 50 bouquets total, and 12 were sunflower bouquets.\n\n\\[\n\\text{Percentage}=\\frac{12}{50}\\times 100=24\\%\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{24\\%}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Great. Now let's take that a step further. How many sunflower bouquets did Faraday sell per day on average during that week? Additionally, Faraday's flower shop was open for 6 days during that week.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Faraday sold 12 sunflower bouquets over 6 days.\n\n\\[\n\\text{Average per day}=\\frac{12}{6}=2\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\text{ sunflower bouquets per day}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "I should also tell you: Faraday sells individual sunflowers for $3 each.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Got it. Individual sunflowers cost **$3 each**. To calculate the total revenue from individual sunflowers, we would also need to know how many individual sunflowers Faraday sold.",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Good, now using that, can you calculate: How many sunflowers was Faraday able to sell after three days? And here are a few things you should know: Faraday sells bouquets of sunflowers for $8 each. Faraday earns $26 per day from individual sunflowers and $56 per day from bouquets.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Over 3 days:\n\n- **Individual sunflowers:**  \n  \\[\n  26 \\times 3=\\$78\n  \\]\n  At \\$3 each:\n  \\[\n  78 \\div 3=26\\text{ individual sunflowers}\n  \\]\n\n- **Sunflower bouquets:**  \n  \\[\n  56 \\times 3=\\$168\n  \\]\n  At \\$8 per bouquet:\n  \\[\n  168 \\div 8=21\\text{ bouquets}\n  \\]\n\nThus, Faraday sold \\(26+21=47\\) sunflower items, counting each bouquet as one item.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{47}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "One more thing — Each bouquet contains 12 sunflowers.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "In 3 days, Faraday sold:\n\n- **26 individual sunflowers**:\n  \\[\n  26 \\times \\$3=\\$78\n  \\]\n- **21 bouquets**:\n  \\[\n  21 \\times \\$8=\\$168\n  \\]\n\nEach bouquet contains 12 sunflowers, so the bouquets contained:\n\n\\[\n21 \\times 12=252\\text{ sunflowers}\n\\]\n\nIncluding the 26 individual sunflowers:\n\n\\[\n252+26=278\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{278\\text{ sunflowers}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. Faraday sells individual sunflowers for $2 each.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "With individual sunflowers priced at **$2 each**:\n\n- Individual sunflower revenue over 3 days:\n  \\[\n  26 \\times 3=\\$78\n  \\]\n- Individual sunflowers sold:\n  \\[\n  78 \\div 2=39\n  \\]\n\nBouquet sales remain:\n\n\\[\n56 \\times 3=\\$168,\\qquad 168\\div 8=21\\text{ bouquets}\n\\]\n\nSince each bouquet contains 12 sunflowers:\n\n\\[\n21\\times12=252\\text{ sunflowers}\n\\]\n\nTotal sunflowers:\n\n\\[\n252+39=291\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{291\\text{ sunflowers}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
